OL,3,AG7 to release up to 100 million barrels
OL,4,Aof diesel and crude oil in bid to stop
OL,5,Asoaring prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis live page is now closed but you
OL,8,Fcan read more in our news story
OL,10,FLeaders from the G7 bloc of advanced
OL,11,Feconomies have agreed to work "in a
OL,12,Fcoordinated manner" to help bring down
OL,13,Fdiesel prices
OL,15,FThey will make production "more
OL,16,Fflexible", release strategic reserves
OL,17,Fof "up to 100 million barrels" within
OL,18,Ffour months, and avoid energy
OL,19,Frestrictions between partner countries
