OL,3,AG7 to release up to 100 million barrels
OL,4,Aof diesel and crude oil in bid to stop
OL,5,Asoaring prices
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe meeting comes after President
OL,8,FDonald Trump threatened to ban diesel
OL,9,Fexports - to bring US prices down -
OL,10,Funless Europe agreed to release its
OL,11,Freserves
OL,13,FFollowing the G7 announcement, Trump
OL,14,Ftells reporters at the White House:
OL,15,F"We're not going to be doing the export
OL,16,Fban"
OL,18,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,19,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,20,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,21,Fthe first time
