OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, UK Transport Minister Keir
OL,8,FMather says Britain's supply of diesel
OL,9,Fis "robust" and "resilient" and the
OL,10,Fcountry has a wide range of sources
OL,12,F"I can barely afford to travel to
OL,13,Fwork", says Kaine from Manchester,
OL,14,Fwhile Richard, from Buckinghamshire,
OL,15,Fsays he's spending nearly #500 a month
OL,16,Fextra on fuel
